  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "<p>Do you want to embrace dynamic and intellectual growth opportunities in higher education? Then Regent College London is for you!</p><p>Regent College London (RCL) offers creative learning opportunities. It collaborates with many universities across the UK to help international students achieve their academic dreams. It focuses on positively impacting each student, encouraging personal growth and academic success.</p><p><strong>About the University</strong></p><p>Established in 2010, Regent College London's success is evident through its academic results and student satisfaction rating (93%). Their unparalleled support to studies and focused classrooms make it a great choice for pursuing higher education.</p><p>Regent College London provides many courses, such as:</p><ul><li>Foundation degrees</li><li>Foundation year routes</li><li>Higher National Diplomas (HNDs)</li><li>Bachelor's and Master's degrees</li><li>Top-up degrees</li></ul><p>The fields of study included are:</p><ul><li>Business and Law</li><li>Engineering and Computing</li><li>Health and Sports Sciences</li></ul><p>These courses provide a firm foundation and serve as a gateway to higher education and career progress.</p><p>For those who don’t have the formal qualifications, RCL offers 4-year Foundation routes.</p><p>RCL also offers Higher National Diplomas (HND). These are equal to the second year of a three-year degree, providing a quicker and more direct route into professions than a full bachelor’s degree. You can complete these courses in two years (full-time) or four years (part-time).</p><p>In addition, RCL offers customised undergraduate programs, such as Bachelor of Science (BSc Hons), Bachelor of Engineering (BEng Hons), and Bachelor of Arts (BA Hons).</p><p><strong>Why choose Regent College London?</strong></p><ol><li>Regent College London offers an unparalleled and accessible learning environment.</li><li>It provides various study options to fulfil the different learning requirements.</li><li>It provides blended learning opportunities and accessibility to technology.</li><li>It also helps you set your academic goals and provides extensive career support.</li><li>It strives to improve your satisfaction with educational performance, as measured by the National Student Survey.</li></ol><p><strong>Student life</strong></p><p>At RCL, you’ll have a well-rounded and supportive experience. You can spend your leisure time in the e-library, which includes e-books, educational resources, and journals.</p><p>The student support team provides service Monday to Friday, through which you can participate in cultural events, adventure activities and individual mentoring sessions.</p><p>RCL conducts well-being support sessions and workshops. This will help you with emotional intelligence, improve your mental health, and offer extra academic access, career support, and IT skills.</p><p>It also has a student support model called HubX, where the customer support officer will immediately respond to your queries.</p>"
    ],
